  "overview": "The world of \"Ninja Way\", closing in on you with powerful visuals and varied action!!\n\n\"Sho\", who became heir to the Ninja Way. \"Kazuma\", who threw himself into a world of evil. Now the fires of a fierce battle woven by these twin brothers are lit!!\n\n迫力の映像と多彩なアクションで迫る「忍道」の世界!!\n\n忍道継承者となった「ショウ」。邪悪な世界に身を投じた「カズマ」。この双子の兄弟が織りなす壮絶なバトルの火蓋が今、切られる!!"
